backend-1   | │                                                                              │
backend-1   | │  ### 2. Join path (as defined in the metadata)                               │
backend-1   | │                                                                              │
backend-1   | │  | Join order | Left table (column) | Right table (column) |                 │
backend-1   | │  |------------|---------------------|----------------------|                 │
backend-1   | │  | 1 | `dev_film.film_id` | `dev_film_category.film_id` |                    │
backend-1   | │  | 2 | `dev_film_category.category_id` | `dev_category.category_id` |        │
backend-1   | │  | 3 | `dev_film.film_id` | `dev_inventory.film_id` |                        │
backend-1   | │  | 4 | `dev_inventory.inventory_id` | `dev_rental.inventory_id` |            │
backend-1   | │  | 5 | `dev_rental.rental_id` | `dev_payment.rental_id` |                    │
backend-1   | │                                                                              │
