backend-1   | │    title     = <descriptive title>                                           │
backend-1   | │    xlabel    = <x-axis label>                                                │
backend-1   | │    ylabel    = <y-axis label>                                                │
backend-1   | │  RULES: If multiple metrics share an X-axis, consolidate them into ONE       │
backend-1   | │  chart. If there are multiple distinct X-axes (e.g. "by Rating" AND "by      │
backend-1   | │  Category"), call save_chart_data ONCE PER AXIS.                             │
